        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ishibosheti eerwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Ishibosheti okhwa Saulo ne aulila ali Abuneri afwiliile e Heburoni, awa kamaani. Baisiraeli boosi baba ne liayaaya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ishibosheti aba ne babaandu babili ba baaba babemeelesi be Baseeri. Mulala aba bali Baana, ne okundi aba bali Rekabu, ba okhwa Rimoni khukhwama Beeroti mu kholo eya Benjamini. (Beeroti lwosi lubalwa khuba lulalakho khu ngoba cha Benjamini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamenywa balwo be khunyoa belukhila e Kitaimu, niio bamenyile nga baakwa khukhwola luno.) ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.9.3"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 9.3",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Yonasani okhwa Saulo aba no mwana owalemala bikele bali Mefibosheti. Aba ne bukhulu bwe kimiiko kiraano nga likhuwa ne liama Yesireeli bali Saulo ne Yonasani bafwiile. Chilomo nga ne chama mu lukoba lwa Yesireeli bali Saulo ne Yonasani bafwiile, omulesi wewe amuyula mala elukha. Mu khuyuyukhana, amupa asi mala amutasa buleme.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono ba okhwa Rimoni omuberoti, Rekabu ne Baana barakikha lukeendo lwe khucha owa Ishibosheti. Bolayo mwiangilwe ne alikho aola.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omukhasi omuliindi we kumuliango owaba ne alikho aseesa engaanu aungula mala liilo lia mutiila. Nio Rekabu ne Baana bepiula munju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga bola munju, bacha mu lusiro nimwo Ishibosheti aaba. Bamunyoola alikho akona, mala bamwiira. Nio bamurusiakho kumurwe, bakubukula mala bakeenda siilo sioosi khubirira mwitooma lia Yoritani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baelesia omwami Daudi kumurwe okwo e Heburoni. Bamuboolela bali, “Kumurwe kwo musiku wowo Ishibosheti okhwa Saulo omusiku wowo owenyanga khukhwira ewe, kuli ano. Luno Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akhwiyachile Saulo ne lisaaye liewe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Daudi aakobosia Rekabu ne wandaaye, babaana ba okhwa Rimoni omuberoti ali, “Nga Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne amenyile mindali, owambonia khukhwama mu busiku bwoosi! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.1.1+2SA.1.2+2SA.1.3+2SA.1.4+2SA.1.5+2SA.1.6+2SA.1.7+2SA.1.8+2SA.1.9+2SA.1.10+2SA.1.11+2SA.1.12+2SA.1.13+2SA.1.14+2SA.1.15+2SA.1.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam. 1.1-16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Omundu mulala echa amboolela ali, ‘Lola Saulo afwiile.’ Ebaasia ali andereere kamakhuwa kamalayi. Ne kakhali namutiila mala namwirira e Sikilaki. Okwo kwaba kumuruungo nikwo namuelesia khulwe chilomo chewe nicho andeerera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne bulaba bubi bukali po, khu baandu baabi babeera omundu okhalikho ne kumusaango tawe, owikonela busa liilo munju mwewe? Luno nja khumwiyacha nga ne mwamwirire, mala mubunie khukhwama khu sibala.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi arusia lilaka, mala basoleeli bewe beera Rekabu ne Baana mala babakhalaka kamakhono kabwe ne bikele. Babasuunga ambi ne litiisi lie mu Heburoni. Ne kakhali babukula kumurwe kwa Ishibosheti bakusiikha mung'ani eya Abuneri e Heburoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
